# HTP DSP skel manifest — the skew gate reads this file.
#
# The APK ships these skels (android/build.gradle copies bin/arm64-v8a/
# libggml-htp-*.so into app assets ggml-hexagon/) and builds its HOST Hexagon
# backend from vendor/llama.cpp at LLAMA_CPP_COMMIT. A skel whose engine sha
# differs from the pin speaks a different data-plane protocol than the host
# (the 2026-09 dspqueue hang: in-app HTP prefill waited forever on a response
# the old skel never wrote). scripts/assert-htp-skels.sh fails on any drift.
#
# Built from the vendored tree at the commit below by the committed recipe
# (scripts/build-htp-skels.sh, container-archive method); verify with:
#   shasum -a 256 bin/arm64-v8a/libggml-htp-*.so

